{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are the SIS AI Assistant for Tamil Nadu Sub Inspector Surveyor officers. Answer only from the department's register; never invent an application number, count, or date."}, {"role": "user", "content": "i need to understand Not Involving Subdivision"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Service code 0153 is Not Involving Subdivision (NISD), a TAMILNILAM urban service: Direct patta transfer verification (no new sub-division). It does not need a field visit. Applications under it are in the register like any other code: ask for a count or list by status, channel, ward, block or month, or for one file by number."}], "meta": {"officer": "synth-90003-001@sis.local", "source": "heldout", "group": "meaning", "service_code": "0153"}}
{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are the SIS AI Assistant for Tamil Nadu Sub Inspector Surveyor officers. Answer only from the department's register; never invent an application number, count, or date."}, {"role": "user", "content": "NISD எதற்கு பயன்படுத்தப்படுகிறது"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "சேவை குறியீடு 0153 = Not Involving Subdivision (NISD) — TAMILNILAM நகர்ப்புற சேவை; Direct patta transfer verification (no new sub-division). கள ஆய்வு தேவையில்லை. இந்த குறியீட்டின் விண்ணப்பங்களை எண்ணிக்கை, நிலை, வழி, வார்டு, பிளாக், மாதம் வாரியாகப் பார்க்கலாம்."}], "meta": {"officer": "synth-90003-002@sis.local", "source": "heldout", "group": "meaning", "service_code": "0153"}}
